"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">26</div><h1>과거완료와 미래</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Plusquamperfekt und Futur</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 26의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 9 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">과거완료 hatte/war + 과거분사를 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">지난 두 일 가운데 먼저 일어난 일을 과거완료로 말하고 nachdem의 시제를 맞춰요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">미래형과 미래완료로 계획·약속·예측·추측을 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">werden이 '되다'·미래·수동 가운데 무엇인지 구별해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hatte&quot;],[&quot;verkauft&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Als ich zur Bäckerei kam, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> der Bäcker das letzte Brot schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(verkaufen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 빵집에 갔을 때 빵집 주인은 마지막 빵을 이미 팔아 버린 뒤였어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Als ich zur Bäckerei kam, <b>hatte</b> der Bäcker das letzte Brot schon <b>verkauft</b>.</div>먼저 일어난 일(빵을 판 일)은 과거완료로 말해요.<br>verkaufen은 haben과 쓰고, ver-로 시작해서 ge-가 붙지 않아요 — hatte … verkauft.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;war&quot;],[&quot;umgezogen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Meine Schwester <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> schon nach Hamburg <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(umziehen)</span>, als ich sie besuchen wollte.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 여동생을 찾아가려고 했을 때 여동생은 이미 함부르크로 이사 가고 없었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Schwester <b>war</b> schon nach Hamburg <b>umgezogen</b>, als ich sie besuchen wollte.</div>이사는 장소 이동이라서 sein과 써요 — war … umgezogen.<br>분리동사는 ge-가 가운데에 들어가요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Ich kannte das Ende schon, denn ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Buch schon einmal gelesen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) bin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wurde</button></div><div class=\"qe\">결말을 안 것보다 책을 읽은 일이 먼저예요.<br>lesen은 haben과 쓰니까 과거완료는 hatte … gelesen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Als ich auf der Party ankam, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> du schon gegangen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wart</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) wurdest</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hattest</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) warst</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gehen은 sein과 써요. du에 맞는 sein의 과거형은 warst예요.<br>wart는 ihr의 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Hattet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span> ihr die Aufgaben schon gelöst, als der Lehrer zurückkam?</div><div class=\"qko\">선생님이 돌아왔을 때 너희는 문제를 이미 다 풀었었니?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Hattet</b> ihr die Aufgaben schon gelöst, als der Lehrer zurückkam?</div>lösen은 haben과 써요. ihr에 맞는 과거형은 hattet이고, 의문문이라서 맨 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;waren&quot;],[&quot;angekommen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Als das Gewitter anfing, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> wir zum Glück schon zu Hause <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(ankommen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">뇌우가 시작됐을 때 우리는 다행히 이미 집에 도착해 있었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Als das Gewitter anfing, <b>waren</b> wir zum Glück schon zu Hause <b>angekommen</b>.</div>도착은 이동이라서 sein과 써요 — waren … angekommen.<br>뇌우보다 먼저 일어난 일이라서 과거완료예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Nachdem sie ihr Studium <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, fand sie schnell eine Stelle.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) abgeschlossen hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) abgeschlossen hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) abgeschlossen war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) abschloss</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주문장이 과거형(fand)이면 nachdem 절은 과거완료예요.<br>abschließen은 haben과 써요 — abgeschlossen hatte.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Nachdem ich die Kinder zur Schule gebracht habe, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich meistens einen Kaffee.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) trank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) trinkte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) trinke</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nachdem 절이 현재완료(gebracht habe)이고 meistens(대개)는 늘 하는 일이에요.<br>그래서 주문장은 현재형 trinke예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;werde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Keine Sorge, ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> dir am Samstag beim Umzug helfen.</div><div class=\"qko\">걱정 마, 토요일에 이사할 때 도와줄게.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Keine Sorge, ich <b>werde</b> dir am Samstag beim Umzug helfen.</div>약속은 werden + 원형으로 말해요. ich → werde, 원형 helfen은 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wirst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> die Prüfung bestimmt bestehen, du hast ja so viel gelernt.</div><div class=\"qko\">넌 분명 시험에 합격할 거야, 그렇게 많이 공부했잖아.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>wirst</b> die Prüfung bestimmt bestehen, du hast ja so viel gelernt.</div>du에 맞는 werden은 wirst예요. werdest나 wirdst는 없는 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Werdet ihr nächsten Sommer wieder nach Spanien fahren&quot;,&quot;Werdet ihr wieder nächsten Sommer nach Spanien fahren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 내년 여름에 또 스페인에 갈 거야?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Sommer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">wieder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Spanien</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">nächsten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">fahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Werdet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">ihr</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Werdet ihr nächsten Sommer wieder nach Spanien fahren?</b></div>Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 werdet가 맨 앞이에요.<br>원형 fahren은 문장 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Der Chef ist heute nicht im Büro. <strong>Er wird wohl beim Zahnarzt sein.</strong><br>굵은 문장의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 그는 치과에 가고 싶어 해요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 그는 치과에 있었어요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) 그는 아마 치과에 있을 거예요</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 그는 치과에 가야 해요</button></div><div class=\"qe\">werden + wohl + 원형은 지금 일에 대한 추측이에요. 미래가 아니에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Die Fenster werden heute geputzt. — 이 문장의 werden은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 본동사 '되다'</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 미래형</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) 수동태</button></div><div class=\"qe\">문장 끝에 과거분사(geputzt)가 있으면 수동태예요.<br>원형이 있으면 미래형, 명사·형용사가 있으면 '되다'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;geworden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Unsere Nachbarin ist letztes Jahr Großmutter <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 이웃 아주머니는 작년에 할머니가 되었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Unsere Nachbarin ist letztes Jahr Großmutter <b>geworden</b>.</div>본동사 '되다'의 현재완료는 sein + geworden이에요.<br>worden은 수동태에서만 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;werde&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Bis zum Sommer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> ich mein Praktikum beendet <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">여름까지는 인턴십을 끝냈을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bis zum Sommer <b>werde</b> ich mein Praktikum beendet <b>haben</b>.</div>미래에 끝나 있을 일은 미래완료로 말해요 — werden + 과거분사 + haben.<br>beenden은 haben과 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Aus Rom werde ich dir eine Postkarte schicken&quot;,&quot;Ich werde dir aus Rom eine Postkarte schicken&quot;,&quot;Ich werde dir eine Postkarte aus Rom schicken&quot;,&quot;Eine Postkarte werde ich dir aus Rom schicken&quot;,&quot;Dir werde ich aus Rom eine Postkarte schicken&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">로마에서 너한테 엽서 보낼게.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Postkarte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">dir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Aus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Rom</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">werde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">schicken</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Aus Rom werde ich dir eine Postkarte schicken.</b></div>werde는 두 번째 자리, 원형 schicken은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Mein Bruder wird im Mai dreißig. — 이 문장의 werden은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) 본동사 '되다'</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 수동태</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 미래형</button></div><div class=\"qe\">뜻은 앞으로의 일이지만 문장 끝에 원형이 없어요.<br>werden + 수(나이)는 '~살이 되다'라는 본동사예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wird&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Der Wetterbericht sagt, dass es am Wochenende stark regnen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">일기예보에서 주말에 비가 많이 올 거래요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Wetterbericht sagt, dass es am Wochenende stark regnen <b>wird</b>.</div>dass 종속절에서는 werden이 맨 끝으로 가요 — … regnen wird.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;verpasst&quot;],[&quot;hatte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Lena war schlecht gelaunt, weil sie ihren Bus <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(verpassen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">레나는 버스를 놓쳤었기 때문에 기분이 안 좋았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lena war schlecht gelaunt, weil sie ihren Bus <b>verpasst</b> <b>hatte</b>.</div>기분이 안 좋았던 것보다 버스를 놓친 일이 먼저예요.<br>weil 절이라서 보조 동사 hatte가 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Als der Arzt endlich kam, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Fieber schon <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) hatte … gesinkt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) war … gesunken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hatte … gesunken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ist … gesunken</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sinken(내려가다)은 상태가 바뀌는 동사라서 sein과 써요.<br>과거 이야기 속 더 앞선 일이니 war … gesunken이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nachdem er den Vertrag unterschrieben hatte rief er seine Frau an&quot;,&quot;Er rief seine Frau an nachdem er den Vertrag unterschrieben hatte&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 계약서에 서명한 뒤 아내에게 전화했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">hatte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Nachdem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Frau</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">seine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Vertrag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">unterschrieben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">rief</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nachdem er den Vertrag unterschrieben hatte, rief er seine Frau an.</b></div>nachdem 절은 과거완료, 동사가 맨 끝이에요.<br>nachdem 절이 앞에 오면 주문장은 동사 rief로 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> '내일은 일찍 일어나야 할 거예요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Morgen muss ich früh aufstehen werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Morgen werde ich müssen früh aufstehen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Morgen werde ich früh aufstehen zu müssen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Morgen werde ich früh aufstehen müssen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">미래형에 화법조동사를 넣으면 원형 두 개가 끝에 와요 — aufstehen müssen.<br>werden 뒤에는 zu를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wird&quot;],[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Tom ist noch nicht da. Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> wohl den Weg nicht gefunden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">톰이 아직 안 왔어요. 아마 길을 못 찾았나 봐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Tom ist noch nicht da. Er <b>wird</b> wohl den Weg nicht gefunden <b>haben</b>.</div>이미 일어났을 일을 추측할 때 미래완료를 써요 — wird … gefunden haben.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Gäste werden sicher schon nach Hause gefahren sein&quot;,&quot;Sicher werden die Gäste schon nach Hause gefahren sein&quot;,&quot;Die Gäste werden schon sicher nach Hause gefahren sein&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">벌써 자정이에요. 손님들은 분명 이미 집으로 갔을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">gefahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">sein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">sicher</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Gäste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Hause</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">werden</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Gäste werden sicher schon nach Hause gefahren sein.</b></div>지난 일의 추측은 미래완료예요. fahren은 sein과 써서 끝에 gefahren sein이 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> '나는 수의사가 되고 싶어요.' (의지)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich bin Tierärztin geworden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich werde Tierärztin.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich will Tierärztin werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich wurde Tierärztin.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">하고 싶은 의지는 wollen이에요. werden은 '되다'라는 본동사로 끝에 와요.<br>Ich werde Tierärztin.은 '수의사가 돼요(될 거예요)'라는 사실·예정이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hatte&quot;],[&quot;angefangen&quot;],[&quot;hatte&quot;],[&quot;verschlafen&quot;],[&quot;war&quot;],[&quot;weggefahren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Als ich am Montag ins Büro kam, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> die Besprechung schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(anfangen)</span>. Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> nämlich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(verschlafen)</span>, und mein Bus <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> mir vor der Nase <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 6\"><span class=\"qh\">(wegfahren)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">월요일에 사무실에 도착했을 때 회의는 이미 시작한 뒤였어요. 늦잠을 잤던 데다가 버스도 눈앞에서 떠나 버렸거든요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Als ich am Montag ins Büro kam, <b>hatte</b> die Besprechung schon <b>angefangen</b>. Ich <b>hatte</b> nämlich <b>verschlafen</b>, und mein Bus <b>war</b> mir vor der Nase <b>weggefahren</b>.</div>세 일 모두 도착보다 먼저라서 과거완료예요.<br>anfangen·verschlafen은 haben, wegfahren은 이동이라서 sein이에요. verschlafen은 ver-라서 ge-가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Nachdem sie im Büro angekommen ist, trinkt sie immer zuerst einen Tee.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nachdem wir gegessen hatten, spülten wir gemeinsam ab.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Als ich aufwachte, war mein Mann schon zur Arbeit gefahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nachdem er die E-Mail gelesen hat, antwortete er sofort.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주문장이 과거형(antwortete)이면 nachdem 절은 과거완료여야 해요 — gelesen hatte.<br>현재완료 + 현재형(늘 하는 일)은 맞는 짝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> werden이 미래·추측으로 쓰인 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er ist in letzter Zeit sehr ruhig geworden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Sie wird das sicher schon gewusst haben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Hier wird ein neues Museum gebaut.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Im Herbst werden die Blätter gelb.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">미래완료도 끝이 원형(haben)이라서 미래형 쪽이에요 — 지난 일의 추측.<br>gelb·ruhig geworden은 '되다', gebaut는 수동태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;haben&quot;],[&quot;wird&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Ich bin sicher, dass sie die Prüfung bestanden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀가 분명 시험에 합격했을 거라고 확신해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bin sicher, dass sie die Prüfung bestanden <b>haben</b> <b>wird</b>.</div>미래완료가 dass 절에 들어가면 werden이 맨 끝으로 가요 — bestanden haben wird.<br>bestehen은 haben과 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Weil er seinen Pass vergessen hatte durfte er nicht einsteigen&quot;,&quot;Er durfte nicht einsteigen weil er seinen Pass vergessen hatte&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">여권을 잊고 왔었기 때문에 그는 탑승할 수 없었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">seinen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Pass</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">einsteigen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">vergessen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Weil</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">durfte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">hatte</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Weil er seinen Pass vergessen hatte, durfte er nicht einsteigen.</b></div>weil 절은 과거완료, hatte가 맨 끝이에요.<br>weil 절이 앞이면 주문장은 동사 durfte부터, 원형 einsteigen은 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gegangen&quot;],[&quot;waren&quot;],[&quot;räumten&quot;],[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> Nachdem die Handwerker <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(gehen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufräumen · 과거형)</span> wir die ganze Wohnung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">기술자들이 간 뒤에 우리는 집 전체를 정리했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nachdem die Handwerker <b>gegangen</b> <b>waren</b>, <b>räumten</b> wir die ganze Wohnung <b>auf</b>.</div>nachdem 절은 과거완료 gegangen waren, 주문장은 과거형이에요.<br>aufräumen은 주문장에서 갈라져 auf가 끝으로 가요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"31\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 31</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"